# {Module Name} Workflow

**FR:** [FR-{###}](../../../../docs/1-requirements/FR_{###}_{name}.md)

## Overview

Data and process flows for {module-name}.

## Data Flow

```
┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐
│   User   │───▶│    UI    │───▶│  Store   │───▶│   API    │
│  Input   │    │Component │    │  Action  │    │  Layer   │
└──────────┘    └──────────┘    └──────────┘    └──────────┘
                     ▲               │
                     │               ▼
                     │          ┌──────────┐
                     └──────────│  State   │
                   re-render    │  Update  │
                                └──────────┘
```

### Input Stage

- Source: {describe the user input or event}
- Validation: performed in the component before dispatching
- Transformation: mapped to store action parameters

### Processing Stage

- Store action processes the request asynchronously
- API layer communicates with the backend
- Response is normalized and merged into store state

### Rendering Stage

- React re-renders subscribed components on state change
- Selectors derive computed values from store state
- Memoization prevents unnecessary re-renders

## Component Lifecycle

```
┌────────────┐
│   Mount    │
└─────┬──────┘
      │ useEffect()
      ▼
┌────────────┐
│   Fetch    │◀──────────────┐
│   Data     │               │
└─────┬──────┘               │
      │ setState()           │ refetch
      ▼                      │
┌────────────┐          ┌────┴───────┐
│  Render    │─────────▶│  Update    │
│    UI      │  event   │  State     │
└─────┬──────┘          └────────────┘
      │ cleanup
      ▼
┌────────────┐
│  Unmount   │
└────────────┘
```

### State Transitions

| From | To | Trigger | Guard |
|------|----|---------|-------|
| Mount | Fetch Data | Component mounts | Dependencies ready |
| Fetch Data | Render UI | Data loaded | No error |
| Render UI | Update State | User interaction | Validation passes |
| Update State | Fetch Data | Refetch needed | None |
| Render UI | Unmount | Route change | None |

## Store Data Pipeline

| Stage | Responsibility | Input | Output |
|-------|---------------|-------|--------|
| Action | Dispatch intent | User event | API request |
| API | Network call | Request params | Raw response |
| Normalizer | Shape data | Raw response | Normalized state |
| Selector | Derive view | Full state | Component props |

## Error Propagation

```
API error (network / server)
    └──▶ caught in store action
         └──▶ stored as error state
              └──▶ rendered by ErrorBoundary or inline message
```

